OL,3,GNEWSAFlood schemes built to protect
OL,4,AStorm Babet village
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree years after Storm Babet tore its
OL,7,Fway through Suffolk, work has been
OL,8,Fcarried out to reduce flood risk in one
OL,9,Fof the worst hit areas.
OL,11,FIn October 2023, hundreds of homes and
OL,12,Fbusinesses were flooded, schools were
OL,13,Fclosed and roads were blocked when
OL,14,Fintense, heavy rain fell.
OL,16,FDebenham was among the worst affected
OL,17,Fareas and three years on, Suffolk
OL,18,FCounty Council has completed natural
OL,19,Fflood management works upstream to
OL,20,Fcontrol surface water flow.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
